# JVM options for Open Liberty — Próximo Pitido server
#
# --enable-native-access: granted to codec modules.
# codecs.input currently uses the Foreign Function and Memory (FFM) API
# (java.lang.foreign.SymbolLookup, java.lang.foreign.Arena) in
# LibsoxrChannelMixer and OggOpusPcmDecoder.
# codecs.sip is included as requested so SIP codecs can use FFM when needed.
--enable-native-access=de.bmarwell.proximo.pitido.codecs.input,de.bmarwell.proximo.pitido.codecs.sip
